# --- TradingView MCP connection (optional: you can also paste this in the UI) ---
# Official TradingView MCP: use the UI instead — Connect panel has the
# https://mcp.tradingview.com/mcp preset and an OAuth "Sign in with
# TradingView" flow (Essential plan+). Env vars can't complete OAuth for you.
#
# Option A — remote / HTTP MCP server:
# TRADINGVIEW_MCP_TRANSPORT=streamable-http
# TRADINGVIEW_MCP_URL=http://localhost:3000/mcp
# TRADINGVIEW_MCP_API_KEY=

# Option B — legacy SSE MCP server:
# TRADINGVIEW_MCP_TRANSPORT=sse
# TRADINGVIEW_MCP_URL=http://localhost:3000/sse

# Option C — local stdio MCP server:
# TRADINGVIEW_MCP_TRANSPORT=stdio
# TRADINGVIEW_MCP_COMMAND=npx
# TRADINGVIEW_MCP_ARGS=-y your-tradingview-mcp-package
